{\b\fs22 Cellular Studio}\par
SMS, balance and modem tools for the built-in LTE modem (Dell DW5820e / Fibocom L850-GL).\par
\par
{\b What gets installed}\par
\bullet  The app, in your user profile (%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Programs\\Cellular Studio). No administrator rights are needed.\par
\bullet  A Start menu shortcut, plus an optional desktop shortcut.\par
\bullet  Optionally, a sign-in entry that starts the app hidden in the system tray.\par
\bullet  Closing the window keeps the app in the system tray; use Exit in the tray menu to quit.\par
\bullet  Messages and settings are stored in %LOCALAPPDATA%\\CellularStudio and are kept when you uninstall.\par
